From 0c90c30a40f3f83f030e755e57f69aacb86e31a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: benny1979 <aldridge.b@googlemail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 14:30:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add iPad Remote: draw on the overlay from an iPad via a relay

- Main: remote bridge connects to a Cloudflare relay, forwards iPad input
  to the renderer and streams JPEG screenshots of the drawing display
- Click-through overlay mode so drawings show while the PC stays usable
- Pairing window with QR code (tray > iPad Remote...)
- Renderer applies remote input through the existing mouse/tool handlers
- remote/relay: Worker + Durable Object relay and the iPad Safari page
- Disable auto-update so upstream builds don't replace the fork

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RHSWpRZ2fTxirLcvPM2kDp
