diff --git a/remote/README.md b/remote/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3b5bb6d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/remote/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,75 @@
+# iPad Remote
+
+Draw on the DrawPen overlay from an iPad (Apple Pencil). The iPad shows a screenshot of the PC
+screen, refreshed about once a second; strokes are drawn by DrawPen on the PC, so they appear on
+the projector and in any screen share.
+
+```
+DrawPen (PC)  <-- wss -->  Relay (Cloudflare Worker)  <-- wss -->  iPad (Safari page)
+  overlay + screenshots       forwards messages              Pencil input + toolbar
+```
+
+Both sides connect outward to the relay, so the PC and iPad do not need to be on the same network.
+
+## 1. Deploy the relay (once)
+
+Needs Node 22 and a free Cloudflare account.
+
+```
+cd remote/relay
+npm install
+npx wrangler login
+npx wrangler deploy
+```
+
+Note the URL it prints, e.g. `https://drawpen-relay.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev`.
+
+## 2. Run DrawPen on Windows
+
+```
+npm install
+npx electron-forge start
+```
+
+(`npm start` sets `NODE_ENV` with Unix syntax and runs a 500x500 dev window; use the command above
+for a normal full-screen overlay. `npm run make` builds an installer.)
+
+## 3. Pair
+
+1. Tray icon → **iPad Remote...**
+2. Paste the relay URL → **Save** → **Connect**.
+3. Scan the QR code with the iPad camera. Optional: Share → **Add to Home Screen** for full screen.
+
+The pairing code is remembered, so the iPad can reconnect later from the same link.
+**New pairing code** revokes the old link.
+
+## Use
+
+- Draw with the Pencil. Fingers only work on the toolbar unless **finger** is on.
+- The PC stays usable: drawings show on a click-through overlay, so the mouse and keyboard still
+  control the presented app. The DrawPen shortcut (Ctrl+Shift+A) still switches to local drawing.
+- **overlay** hides/shows the drawings on the PC; **clear** removes them; **board** toggles the
+  whiteboard.
+
+## Limits
+
+- The iPad image is a screenshot about once a second, not video: fine for slides and documents,
+  not for video or animations.
+- Anyone with the pairing link can draw on and see the PC screen. Keep it private.
+- Protected content (DRM video) and the Windows secure desktop show black.
+- This fork disables DrawPen's auto-update, which would replace it with upstream builds.
+
+## Protocol
+
+JSON text messages; screenshots are binary JPEG, each preceded by a `frame` message.
+
+| From | Message |
+| --- | --- |
+| iPad | `down {p}`, `move {pts}`, `up {p, seq}` - points normalized 0..1 to the drawing area |
+| iPad | `tool {tool}`, `color {index}`, `width {index}`, `undo`, `redo` |
+| iPad | `clear`, `whiteboard`, `overlay {visible}`, `frame` (request screenshot), `hi` |
+| PC | `hello {w, h, colors, overlay}`, `overlay_state {visible}`, `frame {seq, w, h}` + JPEG |
+| Relay | `peer {role, connected}` |
+
+`frame.seq` is the last stroke the PC applied before capturing, so the iPad can drop its local
+preview of strokes that are now in the image.
